{"at":"2026-02-18T19:13:36.514Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":649,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/leads/how-propertylist-generates-direct-leads-for-you/","title":"How PropertyList generates direct leads for you?","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\"><h1>How PropertyList generates direct leads for you?</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\"><br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10228\" class=\"elementor elementor-10228\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-55d62d7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"55d62d7\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7327dd9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7327dd9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Struggling to find qualified leads? <a href=\"http://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> offers targeted advertising on their platform to connect you with potential buyers and renters actively searching for properties. Plus, upcoming features like social media promotion and targeted emails and much more, will further expand your reach. It’s a one-stop shop to supercharge your lead generation!&nbsp;</p><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Direct leads can be ones generated yourself through the <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/microsite-share/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MicroSite – Branded URL</a> or as a <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/portal-leads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Portal Lead</a>&nbsp;which is generated for you.</p><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Find out how it all works below.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"details_cont ent recently_added\" id=\"content_elements\"><h4 class=\"c_head\">Articles</h4><ul class=\"article_list\"><li class=\"page_item page-item-10234\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/how-propertylist-generates-direct-leads-for-you/understanding-the-propertylist-lead-generation-model/\">Understanding the PropertyList lead generation model</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-10235\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/how-propertylist-generates-direct-leads-for-you/optimising-your-listings-for-maximum-lead-generation/\">Optimising your listings for maximum lead generation</a></li></ul><div><br></div></div></div></div><div class=\"doc-btm\">\n\t\t    </div>\n    </article>","seo_title":"How PropertyList generates direct leads for you? • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}